---
description: RPCs and Events communication
globs: *.ts
alwaysApply: false
---
   Client-server communication uses an RPC system to call rpcs remotely and get a response, usually indicating if action succeeded or failed, sometimes with additional information. That's only done if we can't achieve functionality using synced-stores by default.

   - Define new call constants in `altv/src/shared/calls/**/from-*.ts`
   - Register rpc handlers with `rpc.registerClient({Server|Client|webview}Call.From{Server|Client|Webview}.CONSTANT_NAME, (player, ...args) => {})`
   - Call rpc using `rpc.call{Server|Client|Webview}({Server|Client|Webview}Call.From{Server|Client|Webview}.CONSTANT_NAME, ...args)`
   
